["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"KYC Becomes KYA: Sentinel Bio&#x27;s Joshua Monrad on DNA Screening, Uplift Studies &amp; Agent Monitoring uplift study KYA (Know Your Agent) tacit knowledge managed access regime reverse genetics protocol\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-05-cogrev-病毒合成能力已不缺ai-缺的是机器人的灵巧双手/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/708f88bf8d7da201-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:45:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>病毒合成能力已不缺AI，缺的是机器人的灵巧双手</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Monrad认为模型智能已接近够用，但把设计变成活病毒仍需精细湿实验操作——这靠机器人的灵巧双手，现在的机器人还不够灵巧。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">生物安全</span><span class=\"tag\">AI风险治理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Destroying Tumors With Sound: Histotripsy with Dr. Zhen Xu histotripsy cavitation HIFU (High-Intensity Focused Ultrasound) diffraction limit Golden Goose Award\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-05-fromfirstprinc-超声波震碎肝肿瘤-意外让大鼠体内其它肿瘤自行消失/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfee2881de7968b9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">From First Principles</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>超声波震碎肝肿瘤，意外让大鼠体内其它肿瘤自行消失</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大鼠肝肿瘤实验里，被超声波部分击碎的肿瘤组里9/11只不仅未扩散，连未处理的残留病灶也消失——机制是释放抗原激活了全身免疫反应。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">医疗技术</span><span class=\"tag\">肿瘤免疫</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"An AI disaster hits. The president calls Xi. Then what? | Jeremie Harris (crosspost from NonZero) scaling laws superalignment AI Chernobyl track 1.5 / track 2 dialogue MAIM (Mutual Assured AI Malfunction) subthreshold warfare\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-05-eightythousand-中美ai协议靠的不是互信-而是总统感到自己可能被炸死的那一刻/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9ef61ed5d89280cd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">2:22:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>中美AI协议靠的不是互信，而是总统感到自己可能被炸死的那一刻</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他预判会出现一次足够严重的AI事故，让总统本人感到性命堪忧——那一刻美国才会单边暂停训练，并靠切断电缆、网络攻击之类的威胁逼中国同步收手。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中美AI博弈</span><span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"你相信光吗：把几万个GPU用光连起来，到底有多难？| 一期视频看懂共封装光学（CPO） CPO OIO UCIE microring modulator MZI WDM\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-05-laoshi-光刻机已经到了人类工程极限-却仍锁不住微环芯片的波长/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9493e7e74192a076-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"老\"><span class=\"dur\">53:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">老石谈芯</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>光刻机已经到了人类工程极限，却仍锁不住微环芯片的波长</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">硅光学界曾判定微环因波长漂移无法量产，这家公司造了一台激光退火修条设备，把波长良率做到99%，绕开了对顶级光刻机的依赖。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">光互联</span><span class=\"tag\">CPO</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Merve Demirel on the Costs of Migrating for Higher Education in India discrete choice experiment non-pecuniary costs willingness to pay migration penalty\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-05-ideasofindia-真人学长电话劝学-也劝不动印度学生去孟买上大学/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f234d180c819c9b1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">52:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Ideas of India</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>真人学长电话劝学，也劝不动印度学生去孟买上大学</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">给同龄老乡打电话介绍大城市的大学生活后，学生申请本地地级市的比例涨了，但申请孟买、浦那的比例纹丝不动——挡住他们的不是信息，是搬家本身的真实代价。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">高等教育</span><span class=\"tag\">迁移决策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The New CFO: How AI Is Rewriting the Finance Function | Figma CFO Praveer Melwani vibe coding ETL\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-05-a16z-figma-cfo-业务复杂度不变-团队一年后就该变少/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">50:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>Figma CFO：业务复杂度不变，团队一年后就该变少</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">对账、并购尽调原型、投资备忘录生成已被AI压缩到分钟级，Figma CFO Praveer Melwani认为，一旦业务复杂度不再增长，财务团队的人力需求本身会随之收缩。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI财务</span><span class=\"tag\">CFO</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Tokenization, Agentic Trading, Harmonic: Robinhood&#x27;s Mission to Expand Ownership with CEO Vlad Tenev MCP KPI contracts license to operate accredited investor\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-05-nopriors-加密货币靠散户持有赢了政治战-ai却把散户完全排除在外/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bd877a74a55b6594-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">54:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>加密货币靠散户持有赢了政治战，AI却把散户完全排除在外</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">散户从一开始就持有加密货币，因此在监管收紧时能组织起来反击；但私募市场把普通人挡在AI独角兽的融资轮外，只能承受数据中心的噪音和失业风险，却分不到一分钱涨幅。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">代币化</span><span class=\"tag\">智能体交易</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Breaking Down Our Investment Portfolios | #434 benign neglect idiosyncratic risk covered call fund income satiation Fama-French five-factor model\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-05-rationalreminder-这位信奉指数投资的基金经理-却把大笔身家押在自己公司股票上/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0e52c937f0d183da-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:29:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>这位信奉指数投资的基金经理，却把大笔身家押在自己公司股票上</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Ben明知「别重仓雇主股票」是常识，仍把被收购的PWL股权转入OneDigital——他说这是自己主动选的特质风险，因为他是公司参与者，不是领薪水的旁观者。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">资产配置</span><span class=\"tag\">私募股权</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Music Can Be Medicine, with Dr. Dan Levitin default mode network endogenous opioids basal ganglia aphantasia\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-05-sciencevs-音乐止痛是真实的神经机制-但你得先喜欢这首歌/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a3282246c3202bd6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">33:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Vs</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>音乐止痛是真实的神经机制，但你得先喜欢这首歌</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">科学家用冰桶测试证实，喜欢的音乐会让大脑释放堪比吗啡的内源性阿片类物质来提升痛觉阈值，而讨厌的音乐只会释放皮质醇让人更紧张。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">音乐治疗</span><span class=\"tag\">神经科学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"James Bosworth on What Comes After Lula&#x27;s Stunning Win status of forces agreement chavistas\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-05-oddlots-巴西大选次轮变成对首轮领先者的公投-押注87-的预测市场全错/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">32:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>巴西大选次轮变成对首轮领先者的公投，押注87%的预测市场全错</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">因为选民厌恶现任者，首轮投票选出的「赢家」反而把全部火力引向自己，让原本落后的卢拉在次轮完成反超。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">拉美政治</span><span class=\"tag\">巴西大选</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Health Insurance in America Blue Cross Red Scare Campaigns, Inc. wage and price controls\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-05-throughline-锁定美国雇主医保的不是二战意外-而是艾森豪威尔的选择/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1989x1989+0+0/resize/3000/quality/66/format/jpg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F02%2F15%2Fa2ebac794881a9c592b8881be551%2F4c34746d-230d-4248-8438-6f7a55f11d5f.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">52:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>锁定美国雇主医保的不是二战意外，而是艾森豪威尔的选择</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">二战工资管制只是让雇主医保偶然发芽，真正让它变成美国永久制度的，是1950年代艾森豪威尔政府主动把这项税收优惠永久写进法律。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">医保史</span><span class=\"tag\">雇主医保</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Britain&#x27;s First Homo Sapiens LRJ (Lincombeian-Ranisian-Jerzmanowician) leaf points marine isotope stage 3 (MIS3) prism system Aurignacian\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-05-ancients-英国最早智人化石的年代-可能被保存用的胶水测错了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb5d9c468a9839ac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">53:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>英国最早智人化石的年代，可能被保存用的胶水测错了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">这块1927年出土的下颌骨被测定为三万五千年前，但修复用的胶水会让放射性碳测年失真，研究者认为实际年代应该更早。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">旧石器时代</span><span class=\"tag\">尼安德特人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How To Think About Angel Investors As A Solo Founder | Julian Weisser, Solo Founders pulling the thread co-founder of convenience / co-founder of strength key man risk\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-05-solofounders-创业公司死于合伙人分手-独立创始人死于失去希望/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/37e9a6bbbf712536-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">48:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">单人创始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>创业公司死于合伙人分手，独立创始人死于失去希望</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">研究显示约三分之二的创业公司因团队问题而死，合伙人分手是头号杀手；独立创始人没有这个风险，但要独自扛住孤立感和失去动量的风险。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">天使投资</span><span class=\"tag\">独立创始人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"720. Revolution in the Soviet Empire: Revenge of the Red Army (Part 2) Goulash Communism Operation Whirlwind Presidium\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-05-restishistory-匈牙利宣布退出华沙条约-其实在苏军已经打进来之后/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4411977400325163-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>匈牙利宣布退出华沙条约，其实在苏军已经打进来之后</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">纳吉在电台宣布中立、退出华沙条约时，苏联军队其实已经越过边境，这是绝望之举而非挑衅，却也没能换来联合国或西方任何实质援助。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">冷战史</span><span class=\"tag\">匈牙利1956年革命</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"410. JFK: Blood On The Streets Of Dallas (Part 4) magic bullet theory grassy knoll Warren Commission Zapruder film\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-05-empirehist-阴谋论经久不衰-是因为人们不愿接受一个小人物能扳倒总统/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6dcfd4bf69c91d0f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">56:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>阴谋论经久不衰，是因为人们不愿接受一个小人物能扳倒总统</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">普利策传记作者说，法证证据有力指向奥斯瓦尔德独自开枪，他认为人们抗拒这个结论，是因为不愿相信如此重大的历史转折只凭一个边缘人物就能达成。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">肯尼迪遇刺</span><span class=\"tag\">阴谋论</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"WWI&#x27;s Stalingrad: The Siege of Przemyśl Galicia little Russians ring of steel guncotton Battle of Gorlice-Tarnów\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-05-historyhit-一发受潮的炸药-可能让一战没有在1915年结束/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bda40672b88b5654-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">58:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>一发受潮的炸药，可能让一战没有在1915年结束</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一座碉堡的大门因炸药受潮当夜没被炸开，奥匈帝国侥幸没有当场崩溃——节目认为，这类偶然正是一战没有在1915年结束、反而打到1918年的关键之一。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">一战</span><span class=\"tag\">东线战场</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"19.AI眼镜杀手级应用在哪里？影目杨龙昇先给了个相亲的答案 BB方案 PMF SLAM inside out\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-05-tanpai-市场都在看好ai眼镜-这位创始人说明后两年更难/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/68d3da25c54fc635-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"摊\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">摊牌｜创业观察</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>市场都在看好AI眼镜，这位创始人说明后两年更难</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他判断当前眼镜市场规模只有两三百万台，还要被苹果、Meta和国内大厂挤压，真正的拐点要等供应链、内容生态和产品同时成熟的2028至2029年。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI眼镜</span><span class=\"tag\">AR</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"At The Money: How Do Financial Professionals Invest Their Own Money? spreadsheet optimal behaviorally optimal\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-04-mastersinbiz-连理财专家也提前还房贷-留过多现金-只为心安/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d1b7885ac5e511e1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">23:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1104</span></div>\n<h2>连理财专家也提前还房贷、留过多现金——只为心安</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">50位基金经理、顾问在新书里坦白：明知提前还房贷、持有超额现金在数学上不划算，他们还是这么做了，因为心理安稳比理论回报更重要。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">行为金融</span><span class=\"tag\">财富管理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Good Fight Club: Trump Rebuked emotional capture rings of commitment stolen pride blue tsunami gerrymandering competitive authoritarianism\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-04-goodfight-特朗普选民没有觉醒-只是外层支持被生活成本层层剥落/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1104</span></div>\n<h2>特朗普选民没有觉醒，只是外层支持被生活成本层层剥落</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">物价、汽油和住房成本把特朗普的情感俘获一层层剥开，却没有击穿那个仍然忠诚的核心选民群体。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美国政治</span><span class=\"tag\">中期选举</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How To Go From Researcher to Founder CCG CQC SME\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-04-ycsp-说不清解决什么问题-nhs里就没人知道该为你买单/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/968e72a6de5d364b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">9:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1104</span></div>\n<h2>说不清解决什么问题，NHS里就没人知道该为你买单</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">每个创业者都该能一句话说清解决了谁的问题，这样才能被导向NHS里真正管那件事的人，再问他愿不愿意付钱——这才是医疗创业的起点。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">医疗创新</span><span class=\"tag\">NHS</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Bernhard von Gudden: Ludwig II’s Psychiatrist somatic psychiatry non-restraint policy retrospective diagnosis Pick&#x27;s disease\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-04-stuffmissed-写报告前-医生没见过那位被判精神失常的国王/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">35:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1104</span></div>\n<h2>写报告前，医生没见过那位被判精神失常的国王</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">路德维希二世被废黜的依据，是一份古登从未问诊国王本人、只凭政敌证词写成的精神病报告；两人随后双双溺毙，死因至今成谜。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">精神医学史</span><span class=\"tag\">王室秘闻</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Richard Hanania on Conrad&#x27;s Nostromo, Latin American Crime, and Populism material interests negro liberalism\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-04-tyler-一本写于1904年的小说-精准预演了拉美民粹政治的死循环/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/42df6b9f173f5224-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Conversations with Tyler</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1104</span></div>\n<h2>一本写于1904年的小说，精准预演了拉美民粹政治的死循环</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">小说里外国资本把矿业变成国家支柱，也带来发展，但煽动家和腐败将领轮番上位的循环从未被打破——这是拉美政治至今未解的死结。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">拉美政治</span><span class=\"tag\">发展经济学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The New AI Agents That Shop, Plan, and Gossip OpenClaw Moltbook MCP picnic\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-04-a16z-ai助理最大的信任障碍不是隐私泄露-而是让你当众出丑/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">51:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1104</span></div>\n<h2>AI助理最大的信任障碍不是隐私泄露，而是让你当众出丑</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">用户嘴上说担心隐私，真正在意的是不被agent说漏嘴而丢脸——这才是阻碍信任、拖慢渗透的真正瓶颈。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span><span class=\"tag\">消费产品</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Martin Casado on Frontier Model Economics, AI&#x27;s Slowdown, and the Cursor Deal - [Invest Like the Best, EP.498] mythical man month NeoCloud NeoLab OLTP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-04-ilt-最强模型拿下八成市场-但护城河只够撑三到六个月/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5467ed92a069a36b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1104</span></div>\n<h2>最强模型拿下八成市场，但护城河只够撑三到六个月</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">只要市场还在扩张，最前沿的模型就能拿走八成支出；但模型的保质期只有三到六个月，一旦掉队几乎没有长尾可言，护城河随时清零。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">前沿模型经济学</span>\n</div></div></a>"]